{"5170650":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Fishcremental","steam_appid":5170650,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5223070],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>whirlpool<\/strong> turns in the middle of the sea.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you catch goes into it.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch fish<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/1d389d5bdfcac42f0662ce0dc679f975.poster.avif?t=1793650540\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/1d389d5bdfcac42f0662ce0dc679f975.webm?t=1793650540\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/1d389d5bdfcac42f0662ce0dc679f975.mp4?t=1793650540\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Or let the sea do it<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/2d3ead2d3a88ddd18a839cf179b92ab7.poster.avif?t=1793650540\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/2d3ead2d3a88ddd18a839cf179b92ab7.webm?t=1793650540\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5170650\/extras\/2d3ead2d3a88ddd18a839cf179b92ab7.mp4?t=1793650540\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto aim hands the ring over - the sea knows where the good ones are. Switch at any time; the loot keeps coming either way.<\/p><h2 class